{"id":"tegami-mqs3k36f","createdAt":"2026-06-24T13:16:19.863Z","version":"0.0.0","changelogs":{"google-fonts-variable-weight.md":{"filename":"google-fonts-variable-weight.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  npm:@takumi-rs/helpers:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Render every weight of a variable Google Font\n\nA variable font is served as one woff2 reused across weights. `googleFonts` now\ncollapses those faces into a single weightless face so the renderer drives the\n`wght` axis, instead of pinning every weight to the file's default and leaving\n`font-weight: 700` looking regular.\n"},"drop-google-fonts-text-option.md":{"filename":"drop-google-fonts-text-option.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  npm:@takumi-rs/helpers:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Drop the `text` option from `googleFonts`\n\nA `text=` request strips each face's `unicode-range`, so every subset claims full\ncoverage and overlaps the others, making glyph routing ambiguous and defeating the\nrender-time codepoint subsetting and the CSS/woff2 caches. Render already downloads\nonly the glyphs the content uses, so the option was redundant.\n"}},"packages":{"npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/helpers":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["google-fonts-variable-weight.md","drop-google-fonts-text-option.md"],"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:takumi-js":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/core":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-core":{"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-wasm":{"publish":false},"cargo:takumi-svg":{"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-css":{"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-raster":{"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-napi":{"publish":false},"cargo:example":{"publish":false}}}